      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a few more options that aim to maintain a more neutral tone while being more encouraging and supportive:\n\nOption 4:\n\"It looks like your transfer didn't go through right now. This might mean you don't have enough funds in your account. Let's try looking at your options to help you get the funds you need – learn more about available transfer options.\"\n\nOption 5:\n\"Some technical issue has prevented your transfer from going through. Could you be a bit more careful with your transfers, and if not, check if you can add more funds to your account?\"\n\nOption 6:\n\"Unfortunately, your transfer hit a roadblock. Don't worry – it's not uncommon, and we've got some resources to help you get moving. Here are some suggestions to get your transfer processed again.\"\n\nThese options aim to soften the language around failed transactions, encourage the user to take action, and provide a supportive tone while maintaining a professional level of gravitas.",
